data/

# Added by vibegen
.claude/.fuse_hidden*

# The template is meant to be committed; the real .env is not.
!.env.example

# Internal dev handoff (IPs, MAC, host paths) -- never publish.
DEV_HANDOFF.md

# Local agent tooling. Deliberately untracked in a public repository:
#   .claude/settings.json allowed "Bash(*)" -- a blanket shell auto-approval that every
#     cloner would silently inherit -- and its hooks are POSIX-only, so they never ran on
#     the Windows machine this project is developed on.
#   .mcp.json launched two unpinned third-party npm packages via npx, and was malformed
#     anyway (entries sat at the top level instead of under "mcpServers").
# Both still work locally; they are simply no longer published.
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/hooks/
.mcp.json
.vibegen/
